# Week 1 — Responsive Landing Page Clone

**Zynxis Frontend Internship | Task: Modern HTML & CSS Mastery**

## Deliverable

Pixel-perfect clone of the Vercel landing page using **pure HTML5 + CSS3** (no frameworks).

